the rule looks like
&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bolder&quot;&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bolder&quot;&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: lighter&quot;&gt; Am I normal or bold?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;
