if you have a font with three weights
then the innermost span would be the same weight as the outermost span, bolder than the text outside the spans
but lighter than the text inside the middle span
normal weight &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bolder&quot;&gt; bold weight &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bolder&quot;&gt; extra-bold weight &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: lighter&quot;&gt; bold weight&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;
