what is the result of the processing rules?
they're for more than the uri attribute, they use the other attributes too
an access request
Rule for Converting an access Element into an Access Request sounds horrible
ah right, ok, so then they might actually go into Step 7. I have not had a chance to read it
the problem is: in the absence of a security model, it's hard to say what they do
